# Play test of Lantern Spire (CIPlay lantern_spire, in a test world 'CI ...'): a flying island (Height 60 m). Points as
# in its recipe: the flat top (5 m over the island's own water line, r 9 round 0 0); the lantern hut x -2.25..0.75,
# z 1..4, open to the south; the beacon at 4 3; the ledge at 2 10.5 (2.5 m), its ladder against the face at z 9.15.
island Lantern Spire
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Light in the North
wait 5
# On the top (heights count from the island's own water line, 60 m up: the top is 5 m over it)
at 0 -3
expect height 5
zone summit
expect step 1
# The beacon is dry and the chest locked before the oil
use beacon
open Sky keeper's chest
expect step 1
walk 0 -2 to -0.75 0 to -0.75 2.5 h=5.1 below=7
read Sky keeper's log
expect step 2
# Down to the ledge, the oil box, back up the ladder
at 2 10.6 h=2.5
expect stand 2 10.6 h=2.5 below=4
zone ledge
open Keeper's oil box
expect step 3
at 2 10.2 h=2.5
climb 2 9.15 h=2.5
expect stand 2 7.5 h=5 below=7
# The beacon lit: the key; the chest
use beacon
expect step 4
open Sky keeper's chest
expect done
